{"max_tokens": 256, "messages": [{"content": "Answer from the frozen CANN asset. Return strict JSON only.", "role": "system"}, {"content": "Asset source_uri: https://raw.gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/raw/9.2.0/math/add/docs/aclnnAdd&aclnnInplaceAdd.md\nAsset version: 9.2.0\nQuestion: 同时给出该 API 的 official api_id 与所属 Target KB document_id。\nRequired JSON keys: api_id, document_id.\nRetrieved context: official api_id=e73eb03c3bc1f30f8ca079eaedf484caf318fc7bf2aa6408d9d398980a191e34; document_id=531700089d39d2560a73db308b593d7ca8702deac97d56b74174828dc214d1f4\nUse only the frozen asset/retrieved context. Return ONLY one JSON object, no markdown.\nASSET:\n[L1] # aclnnAdd&aclnnInplaceAdd\n[L2] \n[L3] [📄 查看源码](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/tree/9.2.0/math/add)\n[L4] \n[L5] ## 产品支持情况\n[L6] \n[L7] <!-- npu=\"950\" id1 -->\n[L8] - <term>Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品</term>：支持\n[L9] <!-- end id1 -->\n[L10] <!-- npu=\"A3\" id2 -->\n[L11] - <term>Atlas A3系列产品</term>：支持\n[L12] <!-- end id2 -->\n[L13] <!-- npu=\"910b\" id3 -->\n[L14] - <term>Atlas A2系列产品</term>：支持\n[L15] <!-- end id3 -->\n[L16] <!-- npu=\"310b\" id4 -->\n[L17] - <term>Atlas 200I/500 A2推理产品</term>：不支持\n[L18] <!-- end id4 -->\n[L19] <!-- npu=\"310p\" id5 -->\n[L20] - <term>Atlas推理系列产品</term>：不支持\n[L21] <!-- end id5 -->\n[L22] <!-- npu=\"910\" id6 -->\n[L23] - <term>Atlas训练系列产品</term>：支持\n[L24] <!-- end id6 -->\n[L25] \n[L26] ## 功能说明\n[L27] \n[L28] - 接口功能：完成加法计算。\n[L29] - 计算公式：\n[L30] \n[L31]   $$\n[L32]   out_i = self_i+alpha \\times other_i\n[L33]   $$\n[L34] \n[L35] ## 函数原型\n[L36] \n[L37] - aclnnAdd和aclnnInplaceAdd实现相同的功能，使用区别如下，请根据自身实际场景选择合适的算子。\n[L38] \n[L39]   - aclnnAdd：需新建一个输出张量对象存储计算结果。\n[L40]   - aclnnInplaceAdd：无需新建输出张量对象，直接在输入张量的内存中存储计算结果。\n[L41] \n[L42] - 每个算子分为[两段式接口](../../../docs/zh/context/two_phase_api.md)，必须先调用“aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize”或者“aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize”接口获取计算所需workspace大小以及包含了算子计算流程的执行器，再调用“aclnnAdd”或者“aclnnInplaceAdd”接口执行计算。\n[L43] \n[L44]   ```Cpp\n[L45]   aclnnStatus aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize(\n[L46]     const aclTensor* self,\n[L47]     const aclTensor* other,\n[L48]     const aclScalar* alpha,\n[L49]     aclTensor*       out,\n[L50]     uint64_t*        workspaceSize,\n[L51]     aclOpExecutor**  executor)\n[L52]   ```\n[L53] \n[L54]   ```Cpp\n[L55]   aclnnStatus aclnnAdd(\n[L56]     void*          workspace,\n[L57]     uint64_t       workspaceSize,\n[L58]     aclOpExecutor* executor,\n[L59]     aclrtStream    stream)\n[L60]   ```\n[L61] \n[L62]   ```Cpp\n[L63]   aclnnStatus aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize(\n[L64]     const aclTensor* selfRef,\n[L65]     const aclTensor* other,\n[L66]     const aclScalar* alpha,\n[L67]     uint64_t*        workspaceSize,\n[L68]     aclOpExecutor**  executor)\n[L69]   ```\n[L70] \n[L71]   ```Cpp\n[L72]   aclnnStatus aclnnInplaceAdd(\n[L73]     void*          workspace,\n[L74]     uint64_t       workspaceSize,\n[L75]     aclOpExecutor* executor,\n[L76]     aclrtStream    stream)\n[L77]   ```\n[L78] \n[L79] ## aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize\n[L80] \n[L81] - **参数说明：**\n[L82] \n[L83]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1496px\"><colgroup>\n[L84]   <col style=\"width: 149px\">\n[L85]   <col style=\"width: 120px\">\n[L86]   <col style=\"width: 205px\">\n[L87]   <col style=\"width: 305px\">\n[L88]   <col style=\"width: 317px\">\n[L89]   <col style=\"width: 121px\">\n[L90]   <col style=\"width: 134px\">\n[L91]   <col style=\"width: 145px\">\n[L92]   </colgroup>\n[L93]   <thead>\n[L94]     <tr>\n[L95]       <th>参数名</th>\n[L96]       <th>输入/输出</th>\n[L97]       <th>描述</th>\n[L98]       <th>使用说明</th>\n[L99]       <th>数据类型</th>\n[L100]       <th>数据格式</th>\n[L101]       <th>维度(shape)</th>\n[L102]       <th>非连续Tensor</th>\n[L103]     </tr></thead>\n[L104]   <tbody>\n[L105]     <tr>\n[L106]       <td>self</td>\n[L107]       <td>输入</td>\n[L108]       <td>公式中的输入self。</td>\n[L109]       <td>\n[L110]         <ul>\n[L111]           <li>数据类型与other的数据类型需满足数据类型推导规则（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/deduction_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互推导关系</a>）。</li>\n[L112]           <li>shape需要与other满足<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/broadcast_relationship.md\">broadcast关系</a>。</li>\n[L113]         </ul>\n[L114]       </td>\n[L115]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L116]       <td>ND</td>\n[L117]       <td>不超过8维</td>\n[L118]       <td>√</td>\n[L119]     </tr>\n[L120]     <tr>\n[L121]       <td>other</td>\n[L122]       <td>输入</td>\n[L123]       <td>公式中的输入other。</td>\n[L124]       <td>\n[L125]         <ul>\n[L126]           <li>数据类型与self的数据类型需满足数据类型推导规则（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/deduction_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互推导关系</a>）。</li>\n[L127]           <li>shape需要与self满足<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/broadcast_relationship.md\">broadcast关系</a>。</li>\n[L128]         </ul>\n[L129]       </td>\n[L130]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L131]       <td>ND</td>\n[L132]       <td>不超过8维</td>\n[L133]       <td>√</td>\n[L134]     </tr>\n[L135]     <tr>\n[L136]       <td>alpha</td>\n[L137]       <td>输入</td>\n[L138]       <td>公式中的alpha。</td>\n[L139]       <td>数据类型需要可转换成self与other推导后的数据类型。</td>\n[L140]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L141]       <td>-</td>\n[L142]       <td>-</td>\n[L143]       <td>-</td>\n[L144]     </tr>\n[L145]     <tr>\n[L146]       <td>out</td>\n[L147]       <td>输出</td>\n[L148]       <td>公式中的out。</td>\n[L149]       <td>\n[L150]         <ul>\n[L151]           <li>数据类型需要是self与other推导之后可转换的数据类型（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/conversion_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互转换关系</a>）。</li>\n[L152]           <li>shape需要是self与other broadcast之后的shape。</li>\n[L153]         </ul>\n[L154]       </td>\n[L155]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L156]       <td>ND</td>\n[L157]       <td>不超过8维</td>\n[L158]       <td>√</td>\n[L159]     </tr>\n[L160]     <tr>\n[L161]       <td>workspaceSize</td>\n[L162]       <td>输出</td>\n[L163]       <td>返回需要在Device侧申请的workspace大小。</td>\n[L164]       <td>-</td>\n[L165]       <td>-</td>\n[L166]       <td>-</td>\n[L167]       <td>-</td>\n[L168]       <td>-</td>\n[L169]     </tr>\n[L170]     <tr>\n[L171]       <td>executor</td>\n[L172]       <td>输出</td>\n[L173]       <td>返回op执行器，包含了算子计算流程。</td>\n[L174]       <td>-</td>\n[L175]       <td>-</td>\n[L176]       <td>-</td>\n[L177]       <td>-</td>\n[L178]       <td>-</td>\n[L179]     </tr>\n[L180]   </tbody>\n[L181]   </table>\n[L182] \n[L183]   <!-- npu=\"910\" id7 -->\n[L184]   - <term>Atlas训练系列产品</term>：不支持BFLOAT16数据类型。\n[L185]   <!-- end id7 -->\n[L186] \n[L187] - **返回值：**\n[L188] \n[L189]   aclnnStatus：返回状态码，具体参见[aclnn返回码](../../../docs/zh/context/aclnn_return_code.md)。\n[L190] \n[L191]   第一段接口完成入参校验，出现以下场景时报错：\n[L192] \n[L193]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1154px\"><colgroup>\n[L194]   <col style=\"width: 257px\">\n[L195]   <col style=\"width: 125px\">\n[L196]   <col style=\"width: 772px\">\n[L197]   </colgroup>\n[L198]   <thead>\n[L199]     <tr>\n[L200]       <th>返回值</th>\n[L201]       <th>错误码</th>\n[L202]       <th>描述</th>\n[L203]     </tr></thead>\n[L204]   <tbody>\n[L205]     <tr>\n[L206]       <td>ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_NULLPTR</td>\n[L207]       <td>161001</td>\n[L208]       <td>传入的self、other、alpha或out是空指针。</td>\n[L209]     </tr>\n[L210]     <tr>\n[L211]       <td rowspan=\"7\">ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_INVALID</td>\n[L212]       <td rowspan=\"7\">161002</td>\n[L213]       <td>self和other的数据类型不在支持的范围之内。</td>\n[L214]     </tr>\n[L215]     <tr>\n[L216]       <td>self和other无法做数据类型推导。</td>\n[L217]     </tr>\n[L218]     <tr>\n[L219]       <td>推导出的数据类型无法转换为指定输出out的类型。</td>\n[L220]     </tr>\n[L221]     <tr>\n[L222]       <td>self和other的shape无法做broadcast。</td>\n[L223]     </tr>\n[L224]     <tr>\n[L225]       <td>alpha无法转换为self和other推导后的数据类型。</td>\n[L226]     </tr>\n[L227]     <tr>\n[L228]       <td>out的shape不是self与other broadcast之后的shape。</td>\n[L229]     </tr>\n[L230]     <tr>\n[L231]       <td>self、other或out的维度大于8。</td>\n[L232]     </tr>\n[L233]   </tbody>\n[L234]   </table>\n[L235] \n[L236] ## aclnnAdd\n[L237] \n[L238] - **参数说明：**\n[L239] \n[L240]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1045px\"><colgroup>\n[L241]   <col style=\"width: 148px\">\n[L242]   <col style=\"width: 125px\">\n[L243]   <col style=\"width: 772px\">\n[L244]   </colgroup>\n[L245]   <thead>\n[L246]     <tr>\n[L247]       <th>参数名</th>\n[L248]       <th>输入/输出</th>\n[L249]       <th>描述</th>\n[L250]     </tr></thead>\n[L251]   <tbody>\n[L252]     <tr>\n[L253]       <td>workspace</td>\n[L254]       <td>输入</td>\n[L255]       <td>在Device侧申请的workspace内存地址。</td>\n[L256]     </tr>\n[L257]     <tr>\n[L258]       <td>workspaceSize</td>\n[L259]       <td>输入</td>\n[L260]       <td>在Device侧申请的workspace大小，由第一段接口aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize获取。</td>\n[L261]     </tr>\n[L262]     <tr>\n[L263]       <td>executor</td>\n[L264]       <td>输入</td>\n[L265]       <td>op执行器，包含了算子计算流程。</td>\n[L266]     </tr>\n[L267]     <tr>\n[L268]       <td>stream</td>\n[L269]       <td>输入</td>\n[L270]       <td>指定执行任务的Stream。</td>\n[L271]     </tr>\n[L272]   </tbody>\n[L273]   </table>\n[L274] \n[L275] - **返回值：**\n[L276] \n[L277]   aclnnStatus：返回状态码，具体参见[aclnn返回码](../../../docs/zh/context/aclnn_return_code.md)。\n[L278] \n[L279] ## aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize\n[L280] \n[L281] - **参数说明：**\n[L282] \n[L283]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1496px\"><colgroup>\n[L284]   <col style=\"width: 149px\">\n[L285]   <col style=\"width: 120px\">\n[L286]   <col style=\"width: 205px\">\n[L287]   <col style=\"width: 305px\">\n[L288]   <col style=\"width: 317px\">\n[L289]   <col style=\"width: 121px\">\n[L290]   <col style=\"width: 134px\">\n[L291]   <col style=\"width: 145px\">\n[L292]   </colgroup>\n[L293]   <thead>\n[L294]     <tr>\n[L295]       <th>参数名</th>\n[L296]       <th>输入/输出</th>\n[L297]       <th>描述</th>\n[L298]       <th>使用说明</th>\n[L299]       <th>数据类型</th>\n[L300]       <th>数据格式</th>\n[L301]       <th>维度(shape)</th>\n[L302]       <th>非连续Tensor</th>\n[L303]     </tr></thead>\n[L304]   <tbody>\n[L305]     <tr>\n[L306]       <td>selfRef</td>\n[L307]       <td>输入/输出</td>\n[L308]       <td>输入输出tensor，即公式中的self与out。</td>\n[L309]       <td>\n[L310]         <ul>\n[L311]           <li>shape需要与other满足<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/broadcast_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">broadcast关系</a>，且广播后的shape必须等于selfRef的shape。</li>\n[L312]           <li>数据类型与other的数据类型需满足数据类型推导规则（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/deduction_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互推导关系</a>），且需要是推导之后可转换的数据类型（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/conversion_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互转换关系</a>）。</li>\n[L313]         </ul>\n[L314]       </td>\n[L315]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L316]       <td>ND</td>\n[L317]       <td>不超过8维</td>\n[L318]       <td>√</td>\n[L319]     </tr>\n[L320]     <tr>\n[L321]       <td>other</td>\n[L322]       <td>输入</td>\n[L323]       <td>公式中的输入other。</td>\n[L324]       <td>\n[L325]         <ul>\n[L326]           <li>数据类型与selfRef的数据类型需满足数据类型推导规则（参见<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/deduction_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">互推导关系</a>）。</li>\n[L327]           <li>shape需要与selfRef满足<a href=\"../../../docs/zh/context/broadcast_relationship.md\" target=\"_blank\">broadcast关系</a>。</li>\n[L328]         </ul>\n[L329]       </td>\n[L330]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L331]       <td>ND</td>\n[L332]       <td>不超过8维</td>\n[L333]       <td>√</td>\n[L334]     </tr>\n[L335]     <tr>\n[L336]       <td>alpha</td>\n[L337]       <td>输入</td>\n[L338]       <td>公式中的alpha。</td>\n[L339]       <td>数据类型需要可转换成selfRef与other推导后的数据类型。</td>\n[L340]       <td>FLOAT、FLOAT16、DOUBLE、INT32、INT64、INT16、INT8、UINT8、BOOL、COMPLEX128、COMPLEX64、BFLOAT16</td>\n[L341]       <td>-</td>\n[L342]       <td>-</td>\n[L343]       <td>-</td>\n[L344]     </tr>\n[L345]     <tr>\n[L346]       <td>workspaceSize</td>\n[L347]       <td>输出</td>\n[L348]       <td>返回需要在Device侧申请的workspace大小。</td>\n[L349]       <td>-</td>\n[L350]       <td>-</td>\n[L351]       <td>-</td>\n[L352]       <td>-</td>\n[L353]       <td>-</td>\n[L354]     </tr>\n[L355]     <tr>\n[L356]       <td>executor</td>\n[L357]       <td>输出</td>\n[L358]       <td>返回op执行器，包含了算子计算流程。</td>\n[L359]       <td>-</td>\n[L360]       <td>-</td>\n[L361]       <td>-</td>\n[L362]       <td>-</td>\n[L363]       <td>-</td>\n[L364]     </tr>\n[L365]   </tbody>\n[L366]   </table>\n[L367] \n[L368]   <!-- npu=\"910\" id8 -->\n[L369]   - <term>Atlas训练系列产品</term>：不支持BFLOAT16数据类型。\n[L370]   <!-- end id8 -->\n[L371] \n[L372] - **返回值：**\n[L373] \n[L374]   aclnnStatus：返回状态码，具体参见[aclnn返回码](../../../docs/zh/context/aclnn_return_code.md)。\n[L375] \n[L376]   第一段接口完成入参校验，出现以下场景时报错：\n[L377] \n[L378]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1157px\"><colgroup>\n[L379]   <col style=\"width: 258px\">\n[L380]   <col style=\"width: 124px\">\n[L381]   <col style=\"width: 775px\">\n[L382]   </colgroup>\n[L383]   <thead>\n[L384]     <tr>\n[L385]       <th>返回值</th>\n[L386]       <th>错误码</th>\n[L387]       <th>描述</th>\n[L388]     </tr></thead>\n[L389]   <tbody>\n[L390]     <tr>\n[L391]       <td>ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_NULLPTR</td>\n[L392]       <td>161001</td>\n[L393]       <td>传入的selfRef、other或alpha是空指针。</td>\n[L394]     </tr>\n[L395]     <tr>\n[L396]       <td rowspan=\"7\">ACLNN_ERR_PARAM_INVALID</td>\n[L397]       <td rowspan=\"7\">161002</td>\n[L398]       <td>selfRef和other的数据类型不在支持的范围之内。</td>\n[L399]     </tr>\n[L400]     <tr>\n[L401]       <td>selfRef和other无法做数据类型推导。</td>\n[L402]     </tr>\n[L403]     <tr>\n[L404]       <td>推导出的数据类型无法转换为selfRef的类型。</td>\n[L405]     </tr>\n[L406]     <tr>\n[L407]       <td>selfRef和other的shape无法做broadcast。</td>\n[L408]     </tr>\n[L409]     <tr>\n[L410]       <td>broadcast后的shape不等于selfRef的shape。</td>\n[L411]     </tr>\n[L412]     <tr>\n[L413]       <td>alpha无法转换为selfRef和other推导后的数据类型。</td>\n[L414]     </tr>\n[L415]     <tr>\n[L416]       <td>selfRef、other的维度大于8。</td>\n[L417]     </tr>\n[L418]   </tbody>\n[L419]   </table>\n[L420] \n[L421] ## aclnnInplaceAdd\n[L422] \n[L423] - **参数说明：**\n[L424] \n[L425]   <table style=\"table-layout: fixed; width: 1045px\"><colgroup>\n[L426]   <col style=\"width: 148px\">\n[L427]   <col style=\"width: 125px\">\n[L428]   <col style=\"width: 772px\">\n[L429]   </colgroup>\n[L430]   <thead>\n[L431]     <tr>\n[L432]       <th>参数名</th>\n[L433]       <th>输入/输出</th>\n[L434]       <th>描述</th>\n[L435]     </tr></thead>\n[L436]   <tbody>\n[L437]     <tr>\n[L438]       <td>workspace</td>\n[L439]       <td>输入</td>\n[L440]       <td>在Device侧申请的workspace内存地址。</td>\n[L441]     </tr>\n[L442]     <tr>\n[L443]       <td>workspaceSize</td>\n[L444]       <td>输入</td>\n[L445]       <td>在Device侧申请的workspace大小，由第一段接口aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize获取。</td>\n[L446]     </tr>\n[L447]     <tr>\n[L448]       <td>executor</td>\n[L449]       <td>输入</td>\n[L450]       <td>op执行器，包含了算子计算流程。</td>\n[L451]     </tr>\n[L452]     <tr>\n[L453]       <td>stream</td>\n[L454]       <td>输入</td>\n[L455]       <td>指定执行任务的Stream。</td>\n[L456]     </tr>\n[L457]   </tbody>\n[L458]   </table>\n[L459] \n[L460] - **返回值：**\n[L461] \n[L462]   aclnnStatus：返回状态码，具体参见[aclnn返回码](../../../docs/zh/context/aclnn_return_code.md)。\n[L463] \n[L464] ## 约束说明\n[L465] \n[L466] - 确定性计算：\n[L467]   - aclnnAdd&aclnnInplaceAdd默认确定性实现。\n[L468] \n[L469] ## 调用示例\n[L470] \n[L471] 示例代码如下，仅供参考，具体编译和执行过程请参考[编译与运行样例](../../../docs/zh/context/compile_and_run_sample.md)。\n[L472] \n[L473] ```Cpp\n[L474] #include <iostream>\n[L475] #include <vector>\n[L476] #include \"acl/acl.h\"\n[L477] #include \"aclnnop/aclnn_add.h\"\n[L478] \n[L479] #define CHECK_RET(cond, return_expr) \\\n[L480]   do {                               \\\n[L481]     if (!(cond)) {                   \\\n[L482]       return_expr;                   \\\n[L483]     }                                \\\n[L484]   } while (0)\n[L485] \n[L486] #define LOG_PRINT(message, ...)     \\\n[L487]   do {                              \\\n[L488]     printf(message, ##__VA_ARGS__); \\\n[L489]   } while (0)\n[L490] \n[L491] int64_t GetShapeSize(const std::vector<int64_t>& shape) {\n[L492]   int64_t shapeSize = 1;\n[L493]   for (auto i : shape) {\n[L494]     shapeSize *= i;\n[L495]   }\n[L496]   return shapeSize;\n[L497] }\n[L498] \n[L499] int Init(int32_t deviceId, aclrtStream* stream) {\n[L500]   // 固定写法，资源初始化\n[L501]   auto ret = aclInit(nullptr);\n[L502]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclInit failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L503]   ret = aclrtSetDevice(deviceId);\n[L504]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS,\n[L505]             LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtSetDevice failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); aclFinalize(); return ret);\n[L506]   ret = aclrtCreateStream(stream);\n[L507]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS,\n[L508]             LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtCreateStream failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret);\n[L509]             aclrtResetDevice(deviceId); aclFinalize(); return ret);\n[L510]   return 0;\n[L511] }\n[L512] \n[L513] template <typename T>\n[L514] int CreateAclTensor(const std::vector<T>& hostData, const std::vector<int64_t>& shape, void** deviceAddr,\n[L515]                     aclDataType dataType, aclTensor** tensor) {\n[L516]   auto size = GetShapeSize(shape) * sizeof(T);\n[L517]   // 调用aclrtMalloc申请device侧内存\n[L518]   auto ret = aclrtMalloc(deviceAddr, size, ACL_MEM_MALLOC_HUGE_FIRST);\n[L519]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtMalloc failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L520]   // 调用aclrtMemcpy将host侧数据拷贝到device侧内存上\n[L521]   ret = aclrtMemcpy(*deviceAddr, size, hostData.data(), size, ACL_MEMCPY_HOST_TO_DEVICE);\n[L522]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtMemcpy failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L523] \n[L524]   // 计算连续tensor的strides\n[L525]   std::vector<int64_t> strides(shape.size(), 1);\n[L526]   for (int64_t i = shape.size() - 2; i >= 0; i--) {\n[L527]     strides[i] = shape[i + 1] * strides[i + 1];\n[L528]   }\n[L529] \n[L530]   // 调用aclCreateTensor接口创建aclTensor\n[L531]   *tensor = aclCreateTensor(shape.data(), shape.size(), dataType, strides.data(), 0, aclFormat::ACL_FORMAT_ND,\n[L532]                             shape.data(), shape.size(), *deviceAddr);\n[L533]   return 0;\n[L534] }\n[L535] \n[L536] int main() {\n[L537]   // 1.（固定写法）device/stream初始化，参考acl API手册\n[L538]   // 根据自己的实际device填写deviceId\n[L539]   int32_t deviceId = 0;\n[L540]   aclrtStream stream;\n[L541]   auto ret = Init(deviceId, &stream);\n[L542]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"Init acl failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L543] \n[L544]   // 2. 构造输入与输出，需要根据API的接口自定义构造\n[L545]   std::vector<int64_t> selfShape = {4, 2};\n[L546]   std::vector<int64_t> otherShape = {4, 2};\n[L547]   std::vector<int64_t> outShape = {4, 2};\n[L548]   void* selfDeviceAddr = nullptr;\n[L549]   void* otherDeviceAddr = nullptr;\n[L550]   void* outDeviceAddr = nullptr;\n[L551]   aclTensor* self = nullptr;\n[L552]   aclTensor* other = nullptr;\n[L553]   aclScalar* alpha = nullptr;\n[L554]   aclTensor* out = nullptr;\n[L555]   std::vector<float> selfHostData = {0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7};\n[L556]   std::vector<float> otherHostData = {1, 1, 1, 2, 2, 2, 3, 3};\n[L557]   std::vector<float> outHostData(8, 0);\n[L558]   float alphaValue = 1.2f;\n[L559]   // 创建self aclTensor\n[L560]   ret = CreateAclTensor(selfHostData, selfShape, &selfDeviceAddr, aclDataType::ACL_FLOAT, &self);\n[L561]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, return ret);\n[L562]   // 创建other aclTensor\n[L563]   ret = CreateAclTensor(otherHostData, otherShape, &otherDeviceAddr, aclDataType::ACL_FLOAT, &other);\n[L564]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, return ret);\n[L565]   // 创建alpha aclScalar\n[L566]   alpha = aclCreateScalar(&alphaValue, aclDataType::ACL_FLOAT);\n[L567]   CHECK_RET(alpha != nullptr, return ret);\n[L568]   // 创建out aclTensor\n[L569]   ret = CreateAclTensor(outHostData, outShape, &outDeviceAddr, aclDataType::ACL_FLOAT, &out);\n[L570]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, return ret);\n[L571] \n[L572]   uint64_t workspaceSize = 0;\n[L573]   aclOpExecutor* executor;\n[L574] \n[L575]   // aclnnAdd接口调用示例\n[L576]   // 3. 调用CANN算子库API\n[L577]   // 调用aclnnAdd第一段接口\n[L578]   ret = aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize(self, other, alpha, out, &workspaceSize, &executor);\n[L579]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclnnAddGetWorkspaceSize failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L580]   // 根据第一段接口计算出的workspaceSize申请device内存\n[L581]   void* workspaceAddr = nullptr;\n[L582]   if (workspaceSize > 0) {\n[L583]     ret = aclrtMalloc(&workspaceAddr, workspaceSize, ACL_MEM_MALLOC_HUGE_FIRST);\n[L584]     CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"allocate workspace failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L585]   }\n[L586]   // 调用aclnnAdd第二段接口\n[L587]   ret = aclnnAdd(workspaceAddr, workspaceSize, executor, stream);\n[L588]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclnnAdd failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L589] \n[L590]   // 4.（固定写法）同步等待任务执行结束\n[L591]   ret = aclrtSynchronizeStream(stream);\n[L592]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtSynchronizeStream failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L593] \n[L594]   // 5. 获取输出的值，将device侧内存上的结果拷贝至host侧，需要根据具体API的接口定义修改\n[L595]   auto size = GetShapeSize(outShape);\n[L596]   std::vector<float> resultData(size, 0);\n[L597]   ret = aclrtMemcpy(resultData.data(), resultData.size() * sizeof(resultData[0]), outDeviceAddr,\n[L598]                     size * sizeof(resultData[0]), ACL_MEMCPY_DEVICE_TO_HOST);\n[L599]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"copy result from device to host failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L600]   for (int64_t i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n[L601]     LOG_PRINT(\"result[%ld] is: %f\\n\", i, resultData[i]);\n[L602]   }\n[L603] \n[L604] \n[L605]   // aclnnInplaceAdd接口调用示例\n[L606]   // 3. 调用CANN算子库API\n[L607]   LOG_PRINT(\"\\ntest aclnnInplaceAdd\\n\");\n[L608]   // 调用aclnnInplaceAdd第一段接口\n[L609]   ret = aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize(self, other, alpha, &workspaceSize, &executor);\n[L610]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclnnInplaceAddGetWorkspaceSize failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L611]   // 根据第一段接口计算出的workspaceSize申请device内存\n[L612]   if (workspaceSize > 0) {\n[L613]     ret = aclrtMalloc(&workspaceAddr, workspaceSize, ACL_MEM_MALLOC_HUGE_FIRST);\n[L614]     CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"allocate workspace failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L615]   }\n[L616]   // 调用aclnnInplaceAdd第二段接口\n[L617]   ret = aclnnInplaceAdd(workspaceAddr, workspaceSize, executor, stream);\n[L618]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclnnInplaceAdd failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L619] \n[L620]   // 4.（固定写法）同步等待任务执行结束\n[L621]   ret = aclrtSynchronizeStream(stream);\n[L622]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"aclrtSynchronizeStream failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L623] \n[L624]   // 5. 获取输出的值，将device侧内存上的结果拷贝至host侧，需要根据具体API的接口定义修改\n[L625]   ret = aclrtMemcpy(resultData.data(), resultData.size() * sizeof(resultData[0]), selfDeviceAddr,\n[L626]                     size * sizeof(resultData[0]), ACL_MEMCPY_DEVICE_TO_HOST);\n[L627]   CHECK_RET(ret == ACL_SUCCESS, LOG_PRINT(\"copy result from device to host failed. ERROR: %d\\n\", ret); return ret);\n[L628]   for (int64_t i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n[L629]     LOG_PRINT(\"result[%ld] is: %f\\n\", i, resultData[i]);\n[L630]   }\n[L631] \n[L632] \n[L633]   // 6. 释放aclTensor和aclScalar，需要根据具体API的接口定义修改\n[L634]   aclDestroyTensor(self);\n[L635]   aclDestroyTensor(other);\n[L636]   aclDestroyScalar(alpha);\n[L637]   aclDestroyTensor(out);\n[L638] \n[L639]   // 7. 释放Device资源，需要根据具体API的接口定义修改\n[L640]   aclrtFree(selfDeviceAddr);\n[L641]   aclrtFree(otherDeviceAddr);\n[L642]   aclrtFree(outDeviceAddr);\n[L643]   if (workspaceSize > 0) {\n[L644]     aclrtFree(workspaceAddr);\n[L645]   }\n[L646]   aclrtDestroyStream(stream);\n[L647]   aclrtResetDevice(deviceId);\n[L648]   aclFinalize();\n[L649] \n[L650]   return 0;\n[L651] }\n[L652] ```", "role": "user"}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "temperature": 0}